OL,3,GNEWSATrain passengers could be
OL,4,Aovercharged by new pay-as-you-go
OL,5,Ascheme, council warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FA council has warned that Transport for
OL,8,FWales' (TfW) pay-as-you-go system could
OL,9,Fleave some rail passengers paying more
OL,10,F- as it charges all users an adult
OL,11,Ffare.
OL,13,FTfW recently launched a social media
OL,14,Fcampaign to promote the payment
OL,15,Fsystem's availability to passengers on
OL,16,Fthe 27-mile (44 km) Wrexham-Bidston
OL,17,FBorderlands Line.
OL,19,FA TikTok advert for the scheme tells
OL,20,Fviewers it offers passengers TfW's
OL,21,F"best value fare".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
