OL,3,GNEWSATrain passengers could be
OL,4,Aovercharged by new pay-as-you-go
OL,5,Ascheme, council warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Flintshire council said there had
OL,8,Fbeen no explanation that children,
OL,9,Ffamilies and pensioners, who all
OL,10,Fqualified for concessionary fares,
OL,11,Fwould be charged full adult price.
